# Testing the edge cases for the nodes and edges of a graph

# Test 1 - standard case with rounding

created graph simpleGraph1

added node A to simpleGraph1
added node B to simpleGraph1
added node C to simpleGraph1

added edge 1.999 from A to B in simpleGraph1
added edge 3.000 from B to C in simpleGraph1
added edge 3.000 from A to C in simpleGraph1

# Test 2 - case involving cycling of edges

created graph simpleGraph2

added node A to simpleGraph2
added node B to simpleGraph2

added edge 1.000 from A to B in simpleGraph2
added edge 3.000 from B to A in simpleGraph2
added edge 3.000 from A to B in simpleGraph2

# Test 3 - case involving a duplicate edge to one node

created graph simpleGraph3

added node A to simpleGraph3

added edge 1.000 from A to A in simpleGraph3
added edge 2.000 from A to A in simpleGraph3


